sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Agent as Metric Agent
    participant IG as Ingestion Gateway
    participant Kafka as Kafka
    participant Flink as Flink Stream Processor
    participant TSDB as Druid/TSDB Storage
    participant QS as Query Service
    actor Dash as Dashboard User

    Agent->>IG: Flush metric payload
    IG->>Kafka: Publish to metrics topic
    Kafka->>Flink: Consume metrics stream
    Flink->>Flink: Apply sliding window rollup
    Flink->>TSDB: Write aggregated metrics
    Dash->>QS: Request dashboard data
    QS->>TSDB: Query time-series data
    TSDB-->>QS: Return data points
    QS-->>Dash: Render dashboard
